{"id":2645,"name":"Shirokuma Cafe","slug":"shirokuma_cafe","synopsis":"Shirokuma Cafe revolves around a Canadian white bear that quits his boring job and starts a cafeteria near a zoo. He loves telling tall tales and always brags about himself. According to him, he was picked up by a human couple who owns a diner while he was drifting around on an iceberg. \n\nThough he has lost all contact with his Canadian family, he has discovered a new home in serving the diners' clientele, thanks to the kind couple. His caf&eacute; is an embodiment of his personality. The place is always packed with many regulars, animals and humans, who are drawn by his charismatic magnetism. \n\n(Source: Crunchyroll) ","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2012,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:35","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 07:54:52","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":12815},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":12815},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":6821},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":8934},{"site":"ANN","externalId":13985},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":4754},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5277,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/KdnrOUENbkX8myx7vX8i9JP5jrivJvbxaNdnDQ9A.jpg"},{"id":5278,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/MbdeLAKI6ez9wpMf0wX4CazfAyVCeKWiImVB4e0f.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":44,"name":"Pierrot","slug":"pierrot"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":4759,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":4759,"title":"Boku ni Invitation","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":5436,"version":1,"episodes":"1-26","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":4175,"basename":"ShirokumaCafe-OP1.webm","filename":"ShirokumaCafe-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/ShirokumaCafe-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":33941305,"resolution":720,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","tags":"NCBD","audio":{"id":3810,"basename":"ShirokumaCafe-OP1.ogg","filenam